{
  "$comment": "Route table (CT-03): route name → native page or H5 path (规划/01 §4.2, 03 §4.4). Every jump is {route, params} (拍板第二批 TECH-04); external links use {route: ExternalPage, params: {url}}. since is per platform (拍板第二批 TECH-07): null = not shipped on that platform yet; an unknown route or a since above the app version opens the upgrade page. h5_path is relative to config.h5_base_url. InvitedFriends and LevelUpgrade are P1 with since null (the bridge answers unsupported); CustomPage, MyWatches and WatchLanding are added when they ship. debug_only routes open only in debug / staging builds (TECH-11). entry lists where a route may be opened from (route_entry: in_app, push, deeplink; values only from 规划/08 BR-ID-10 细则「路由入口矩阵」; InvitedFriends and LevelUpgrade are not in the matrix and are in_app only, orchestrator decision D-13). push means a route the server returned for a message id; any route carried directly in launch parameters is checked as deeplink. agent_guide (boolean, default false; 规划/04 §10, D31): true only on the candidate routes of 规划/08 BR-AI-01 细则「页面引导」 (Wallet, WithdrawRecords, AuthManage, OrderList, InviteShare, Messages); an Agent page_guide card and the two earnings_summary buttons may open only these, and entry stays as in BR-ID-10. agent_guide_account (phone | delete | fund) marks the account-security routes the Agent never guides to and answers with an agent.guide.account.* text instead (BR-TEXT-22); such routes are never agent_guide. FavoritesPickShare (F-SHARE-11 ③, pick a product from my favorites to share) is a selection state inside ShareHub, not a route.",
